      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "To combat HIV-1 diversity, we are developing a multienvelope vaccine (comprising DNA, vaccinia virus and protein vectors). Toward this goal, we conducted a phase I clinical trial of EnvPro, a gp140 protein formulated in alum. The vaccine was well tolerated and elicited an immune response in every trial participant."},
